lan for the summer. \"Let's go to Phu Quoc island!\" Tom says. \"That is a great idea,\" Anna says. Nam is worried: \"I do not have money.\" \"Maybe we can work at Mrs. Rosa's café,\" Mai says. \"Then we will have money soon.\" Nam smiles. \"I hope Mrs. Rosa will say yes!\" Mai thinks about the future. Her dream is to visit Tom's family in Canada one day.","question":"Why is Nam worried?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"He does not have money.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Kế hoạch mùa hè\".","id":"u16n4l2-e01","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Why is Nam worried?"},"skillIds":["reading","u16.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"At a hotel"},{"id":"c2","text":"At Mrs. Rosa's café"},{"id":"c3","text":"At school"}],"passage":"Last weekend, Mai and her friends went to the Mid-Autumn Festival. They saw lanterns and ate mooncakes. Now they have a plan for the summer. \"Let's go to Phu Quoc island!\" Tom says. \"That is a great idea,\" Anna says. Nam is worried: \"I do not have money.\" \"Maybe we can work at Mrs. Rosa's café,\" Mai says. \"Then we will have money soon.\" Nam smiles. \"I hope Mrs. Rosa will say yes!\" Mai thinks about the future. Her dream is to visit Tom's family in Canada one day.","question":"Where can they work, Mai says?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"At Mrs. Rosa's café\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c2","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Kế hoạch mùa hè\".","id":"u16n4l2-e02","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Where can they work, Mai says?"},"skillIds":["reading","u16.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","text":"Trung"},{"id":"t2","text":"Tết"},{"id":"t3","text":"phê"},{"id":"t4","text":"yêu"},{"id":"t5","text":"thu"},{"id":"t6","text":"thấp"},{"id":"t7","text":"Tôi"},