 the summer. \"Let's go to Phu Quoc island!\" Tom says. \"That is a great idea,\" Anna says. Nam is worried: \"I do not have money.\" \"Maybe we can work at Mrs. Rosa's café,\" Mai says. \"Then we will have money soon.\" Nam smiles. \"I hope Mrs. Rosa will say yes!\" Mai thinks about the future. Her dream is to visit Tom's family in Canada one day.","question":"What is Mai's dream?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"To visit Tom's family in Canada\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c2","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Kế hoạch mùa hè\".","id":"u16n4l2-e05","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"What is Mai's dream?"},"skillIds":["reading","u16.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"maxChars":200,"placeholder":"Viết những gì bạn nghe"},"explanation":"Bạn nghe: \"We will go to a concert on Saturday.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["We will go to a concert on Saturday.","We'll go to a concert on Saturday."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"Câu có 8 từ. Nghĩa: \"Chúng tôi sẽ đi xem hòa nhạc vào thứ Bảy.\"","id":"u16n4l2-e06","nonAudioAlternative":{"content":{"maxChars":200,"placeholder":"Viết bằng tiếng Anh"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"We will go to a concert on Saturday.\". Cũng đúng: \"We'll go to a concert on Saturday.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["We will go to a concert on Saturday.","We'll go to a concert on Saturday."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"\"go\" = đi; \"will\" = sẽ; \"concert\" = buổi hòa nhạc","id":"u16n4l2-e06a","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Chúng tôi sẽ đi xem hòa nhạc vào thứ Bảy."},"skillIds":["listening","u16.grammar"],"type":"textTranslation","vocabularyIds":["u5.go","u16.will","u16.concert"]},"prompt":{"audioAssetId":"a.u16.s13.n","locale":"vi-VN","text":"Nghe và viết lại bằng tiếng Anh"},"skillIds":["listening","u16.grammar"],"type":"dictation","vocab